Because this would run right into

00:36:47.810 --> 00:36:49.310
Castle's queenside, and now the Knight

00:36:49.310 --> 00:36:50.330
looks kind of useless.

00:36:50.930 --> 00:36:52.370
Now the Knight looks kind of useless.

